OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the volunteers restoring
OL,4,A'missing mile' canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn army of volunteers has dedicated
OL,7,Ftheir evenings, weekends and retirement
OL,8,Fto rebuilding a historic canal so
OL,9,Fgenerations can enjoy it for hundreds
OL,10,Fof years to come.
OL,12,FAfter six years of planning, volunteers
OL,13,Ffrom the Cotswold Canal Trust have
OL,14,Fbegun constructing a section of the
OL,15,FStroudwater Navigation waterway canal
OL,16,Fin Gloucestershire, known as the
OL,17,FMissing Mile project.
OL,19,FOnce complete, it will create a
OL,20,Fnavigable route from the River Severn
OL,21,Fto the River Thames, the Trust said.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
