OL,3,GNEWSAMeet the volunteers restoring
OL,4,A'missing mile' canal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatthew Jackson, construction team
OL,7,Fleader, said: "You're doing something
OL,8,Fwhich will be there 1,500 years from
OL,9,Fnow and it's a legacy thing. It'll be
OL,10,Fthere for children and whoever comes
OL,11,Fafter us for years to come."
